   - `Interval.fromISO("P1Y/2016-01-01")` does not throw and is valid;
   - `Interval.fromISO("2016-01-01/P1Y", { zone: "Europe/Paris" })` does not throw, is valid, and `start.zoneName === "Europe/Paris"`;
   - `Interval.fromISO("hello")` DOES throw (unparsable);
   - `Interval.fromISO("foo/bar")` DOES throw;
   - then with `Settings.throwOnInvalid = false`: `Interval.fromISO("hello").isValid === false` and `invalidReason === "unparsable"`; `Interval.fromISO("2016-01-01/P1Y").isValid === true`.
